templates/ in this repository contains code adapted from HyperFrames (https://github.com/heygen-com/hyperframes,
npm package "hyperframes"), Copyright HeyGen, licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Adapted registry items (hyperframes@0.9.41 catalog):
  transition.js, transition.html   <- "zoom-through-transition", "whip-pan-cut" (and block "whip-pan")
  counter.html                     <- "number-wheel" (landing pulse after "count-up")
  browser_stage.html               <- "browser-device-stage"
  chat_thread.html                 <- "chat-thread", "chat-message"

Changes: rewritten as standalone deterministic scenes for this repo's seek(t) contract (window.DURATION,
window.ready, pure window.seek(t), cutTimes, motionPx); GSAP timelines replaced by closed-form easing from
core/kit.js; restyled, re-timed and parameterised (PARAMS object / URL query). No GSAP code is included.
Each adapted file carries a header naming its source block.

tools/studio/ does not include HyperFrames code; it installs the npm package at run time (gitignored).
